        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>FII-3240 First Impressions Door Pull - 3240/300, 3240/600</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis incredible door pull can be used in many applications such as:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance and Patio Doors</li>\r\n<li>Appliances, such as Refrigerators and Freezers</li>\r\n<li>Glass Doors, such as on Showers or Storefronts</li>\r\n<li>Furniture, such as Amoures and Cabinets</li>\r\n<li>Just about anywhere a door pull is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese pulls are very high quality, and very versatile as functional decor. \r\n</p>\r\nEveryone who visits will wonder were you got these incredible pulls, they are very dramatic, and unforgettable.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\">\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull is available in 2 lengths.<br>\r\nThickness of pull is 1\" hollow Aluminum.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<b>\r\n3240/300 - Total Length 11-13/16\", Center to Center Mount - 10\"<br>\r\n3240-600 - Total Length 23-5/8\", Center to Center Mount - 21-13/16\"<br>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSold individually.\r\n</p>",
